  "title": "Code-along: Start building with Swift and SwiftUI",
  "description": "Learn the basics of app development with Swift and SwiftUI. In this online code-along, you’ll build a simple view from an iOS demo app in Xcode, add text fields and photos to capture input, and save information using SwiftData. By the end of the session, you’ll have a complete, interactive interface. To code along, you’ll need a Mac running macOS Sonoma 14.0 or later and Xcode 15 or later. Conducted in English.",
